ON THE MEASUREMENTS

Every number in this repository was measured on specific machines listed in the
corresponding platform report, and is provided as-is with no warranty of
reproducibility on other hardware. Read the limitations sections before citing
anything.

Two limitations are worth repeating here because they are easy to miss:

  - Some single-GPU baselines are substitutions, not measurements. Each report
    states which.
  - MTP (speculative decoding) acceptance rates depend on the prompt fixture and
    on the `ignore_eos` setting used here. Do not carry those absolute values to
    other workloads.

ON THE FIXTURE

The fixture text is not included in this repository. It is rebuilt at run time
from Korean Wikisource at the revisions pinned in `harness/fixture.lock.json`.
The underlying work — Yi Kwang-su, "Mujeong" (무정), 1917 — is in the public
domain. Wikisource content is otherwise available under CC BY-SA 4.0.
